# Chandra, Awakened Inferno +2 in a three-player game gives each opponent (Bot2 and Bot3) an emblem, and Bot1 none (CR 114.2); each emblem
# burns its owner at that owner's own upkeep (turn 2 Bot2, turn 3 Bot3). A -X of 0 on Bot1's own Ornithopter pays no damage and leaves
# loyalty 8 (6+2) minus 0: X can be zero, so it removes no counters and deals none (CR 107.1b).

